NOTICE — lineage beyond this repo's own code:

* The measurement-collapse idiom (Born rule over amplitudes; inverse-CDF shot
  sampling) ports the algorithm of SuperInstance/MicroMoth-quilt `micromoth.py`,
  which is (C) Moth Quantum 2024 and (C) IBM 2023 (MicroQiskit lineage),
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No source code was copied;
  the algorithmic lineage is credited here per that license's spirit. See
  https://github.com/SuperInstance/MicroMoth-quilt (study commit
  014f1f293f62c82ae35b5763503930f3a9d7ecec) and docs/SURROGATE.md.
* docs/CELL-MAPPING.md (same repo) is the design receipt this sampler
  implements: quantum ops as quilt cells; the seed as part of a collapse's
  identity.
